 nths\\nCategory: Storytime\\n\\nThis bus tour celebrates Chicago as the bi
 rthplace of Black history. Led by Chicago’s own Urban Historian Sherman 
 “Dilla” Thomas of Mahagany Tours \, he will guide tourists to key Chic
 ago locations that fostered the growth of Black history as an academic sub
 ject\, and the organization that started it\, the Association for the Stud
 y of Negro Life and History\, now the Association for the Study of African
  American Life and History (ASAALH)\, founded in 1915 at the Wabash YMCA. 
 Learn more in our archive\\n\\nMore info: https://chipublib.bibliocommons.
